Apple announced new <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/mac-mini/">Mac mini</a> machines this week, and the lower-end models include the first M6 chip. The M6 era will be a little complicated, because few Macs are going to get it. We won't have M6 Pro or M6 Max chips, which shakes up the Mac lineup for the next couple of years.<br/>
